# Per-Dockerfile ignore for the web image (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Deny-list: the builder stage needs the workspace source, so keep everything except
# host installs, build artifacts, secrets, and repo meta.

# Never copy host installs or build artifacts into the image —
# the builder stage produces its own via pnpm install + turbo build (incl. a fresh .output).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.output
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/generated

# Secrets must never enter a build context (they would persist in image layers).
.env
.env.*

# Irrelevant to image builds — keeps the context small and the cache stable.
.git
.github
.claude
.husky
.vscode
apps/docs
